---
title: "initialize (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_validate_params --> q_validate_timing: validate startTime < endTime
    q_validate_timing --> q_validate_timing2: validate endTime < refundEndTime
    q_validate_timing2 --> q_validate_invest: validate minimumInvestAmount > 0
    q_validate_invest --> q_set_config: set bidToken, askToken, addresses
    q_set_config --> q_set_timing: set startTime, endTime, refundEndTime
    q_set_timing --> q_set_fees: set legionFee, referrerFee bps values
    q_set_fees --> q_set_ecies: set ECIES public key for bid encryption
    q_set_ecies --> [*]: emit Initialized

    note right of q_validate_timing
        INV-001: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-002: active sale between 1 hour and 12 weeks
        INV-003: refund period between 1 hour and 2 weeks
    end note

    note right of q_set_ecies
        INV-004: ECIES public key enables sealed bid encryption
        INV-005: public key must be valid elliptic curve point
    end note
